    "detailed_description": "<h1>MORE GAMES</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Check this games from Art Games Studio:</strong></h2><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544860/extras/85a00cecc59eb69483b1b4bc3a9b65ab.poster.avif?t=1724734804\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544860/extras/85a00cecc59eb69483b1b4bc3a9b65ab.webm?t=1724734804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544860/extras/85a00cecc59eb69483b1b4bc3a9b65ab.mp4?t=1724734804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Wiktor</strong> - Young, insecure, and the reserved boy wakes up in the foggy, seemingly abandoned place, where things are not always what they seem...<br>Guide him during his <strong>puzzle-platformer, side-scrolling adventure</strong>, discover forgotten Slavic legends, and find things that nazis left buried after World War II.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544860/extras/5b63dacbc8459e2be5363fef26ad6b05.poster.avif?t=1724734804\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544860/extras/5b63dacbc8459e2be5363fef26ad6b05.webm?t=1724734804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544860/extras/5b63dacbc8459e2be5363fef26ad6b05.mp4?t=1724734804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Through platforming elements, challenging puzzles and characters met, slowly uncover the boy's purpose in the world he found himself in. <br>Discover beautiful and magical polish landscape touched by the Third Reich during Second World War. Help Wiktor survive encounters with creatures that inhabit the forest. <br>Dive deep into a dark world filled with magical creatures and secrets for you to discover.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Get lost in the beautiful and magical polish landscape touched by the Third Reich during Second World War.<br></li><li>Solve engaging puzzles.<br></li><li>Test yourself in challenging platforming elements.<br></li><li>Survive encounters with creatures that inhabit the forest.<br></li><li>Manipulate the light to unravel secrets and keep yourself sane<br></li><li>Meet characters with unclear motives.<br></li><li>Discover the boy\u2019s purpose in the world he found himself in.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544860/extras/81474a65234cd9ab7c570b703c8b8f6b.poster.avif?t=1724734804\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544860/extras/81474a65234cd9ab7c570b703c8b8f6b.webm?t=1724734804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544860/extras/81474a65234cd9ab7c570b703c8b8f6b.mp4?t=1724734804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>8874</strong> uses a photometric system to reflect real objects and locations from Walbrzych, an old mining town, and the surrounding areas of Dolny Slask in Poland.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544860/extras/1957f6815c67c6a73a799c0ed16e7eef.avif?t=1724734804\" /></div>",
